{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "6e51b604d84b0c5fed9207880aa56257f2560ddfdd35c43b3c55689d4440cc37", "ja": "{$P$}、おはよーなの～。\nあふぅ。", "zh": "{$P$}，早安唷～\n啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fd44df454f051057f06771277f3f38f8c11ced48c0902c64a5e576accea0e40e", "ja": "おはよう、美希。ずいぶん眠そうだな……。\nもう収録が始まるのに、大丈夫か？", "zh": "早安，美希，你看起来很困啊……\n马上就要开始录影了，你这样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "d6ba01594191087f64e02ac9d402ae95ac12df186a975aaf2fe1a208affabd66", "ja": "うん、ミキ的には大丈夫って思うな。\nだってこれ、『ゆったり寝台列車の旅』だよね？", "zh": "嗯，没有问题，美希是这样觉得呢。\n因为这节目是叫做『悠悠哉哉的卧铺列车之旅』对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "3d6066415fbe01177e8bbd21cf10211e780993172602eb1c979abf132a8958eb", "ja": "なら、ミキもゆったりしてた方がいいし。\n準備はバッチリ、なの～。", "zh": "这样的话，那美希也悠悠哉哉的比较好呀。\n美希做好万全准备了唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2529b7ff281dce9a1a0793da5aa44c13768799ef851fe52d51cfff638effc863", "ja": "そ、そうか。ちゃんと番組のコンセプトを\n把握してたんだな。頼もしいぞ、美希！", "zh": "这、这样啊。看来你有清楚了解节目的主旨，\n你很可靠喔，美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "274a1fa67108fc944ae5d8eedace6b606423da3b0dc52cf774393bd8d538dcf9", "ja": "わかってもらえてよかったの。それじゃあ、次の駅に\n着いたら起こしてね。……おやすみなさいなの～。", "zh": "你能明白就太好了，那么，到下一站的时候\n再叫醒美希喔……美希先睡了唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1efaed43ab3ef30c6eb6ddd519353ef54acef27d6f573920ed7316bcaceef524", "ja": "あ、こらっ！\nそれじゃ番組にならないって……美希ー！", "zh": "啊，喂！\n那样子就没办法做节目了啊……美希──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
